# In-app display titles

Inside the phone app, every **Instrument Serif** title (`var(--font-display)`) must keep Figma’s **0.5px outside stroke**.

This is already applied globally in `screens.css` for `.screen :is(h1, h2, h3, h4)` and `.display-title`.

- Prefer `h1`–`h4` for those titles so the stroke is automatic.
- If the title is not a heading, add class `display-title`.
- Do not restroke titles in the studio chrome (outside `.screen`).
- Do not change `--display-stroke` to `0.5px`: CSS stroke is centered; `1px` + `paint-order: stroke fill` equals Figma’s 0.5 outside.
